方查竞品大盘数据（蝉妈妈、新抖等第三方数据分析平台）\n1. 蝉妈妈、新抖等，搜索品牌名：**Wifer/品味生活好夫人**，可以看到品牌整体大盘、单品预估销量、直播带货销量、达人带货分布（⚠️属于**估算指数，非平台原始精确订单**，仅用于参考）\n\n## 四、补充说明\n1. 抖音**不会对外公开店铺全店真实总销量**，普通用户只能看到单品页面上的“已售”；完整真实成交数据只有店铺商家账号登录抖店罗盘才能查看\n2. 前端商品【已售】统计口径：包含已付款订单，后续退款不会立刻扣减前端展示数字，会和罗盘后台真实成交有差异。\n","source_capture_status":"captured","source_cards":[{"ordinal":1,"title":"商品概览& 详情-如何分析商品不同渠道成交数据和单品直播高光片段?-抖音电商学习中心，抖店官方教你运营抖音小店","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHJAanDCCT8b?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=0fce23c7-ba10-4e8d-ba13-29448cd6e11f","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHJAanDCCT8b?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=0fce23c7-ba10-4e8d-ba13-29448cd6e11f","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":2,"title":"抖音电商罗盘最新最全介绍手册(达人版)-抖音电商学习中心，抖店官方教你运营抖音小店","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/113166?btm_ppre=a4977.b5856.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=140da441-3f9b-4ace-b852-84e3badf920e","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/113166?btm_ppre=a4977.b5856.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=140da441-3f9b-4ace-b852-84e3badf920e","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":3,"title":"抖音商品销量查询全攻略！#抖音商品 #抖音商品推荐 #抖音商品销量 #抖音商品销量排行榜","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7648897981651183046","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7648897981651183046","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":4,"title":"抖音电商-学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cHSLjJ4EXZ57/cHSLjJ4EXZ57lHSLwWrdnmCx?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=map","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cHSLjJ4EXZ57/cHSLjJ4EXZ57lHSLwWrdnmCx?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=map","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":5,"title":"罗盘双11大促作战攻略","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cHcPPwSCPcym/cHcPPwSCPcymlHcQ92eWjfgY?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&fro