ormalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cHcPPwSCPcym/cHcPPwSCPcymlHcQ92eWiurC?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":19,"title":"好夫人电饭煲_好夫人 Wifer/品味生活好夫人钛胆低糖电饭煲多功能电饭锅不粘锅3L煮饭多少钱-什么值得买","url":"https://m.smzdm.com/p/169473977/","normalized_url":"https://m.smzdm.com/p/169473977/","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":20,"title":"Wifer/品味生活好夫人_抖音品牌投放数据分析 - 蝉妈妈·创意","url":"https://cy.chanmama.com/open/brandRank/0300402941062.html","normalized_url":"https://cy.chanmama.com/open/brandRank/0300402941062.html","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":21,"title":"佛山市阿伊达电器有限公司","url":"https://shuidi.cn/company-6bb5e5609be28b35c4cf61dc57238870.html?from=doubao","normalized_url":"https://shuidi.cn/company-6bb5e5609be28b35c4cf61dc57238870.html?from=doubao","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":22,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":23,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":24,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":25,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":26,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":27,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true}],"substantive":true,"replacement":false,"judgment":null},{"date":"2026-10-15","repeat_index":3,"answer_text":"# ✅分两种情况：普通用户（游客） / 商家后台\n店铺：**Wifer/品味生活好夫人**\n\n## 一、普通抖音APP（游客，只能看单品【已售】，看不到店铺总销量）\n1. 抖音搜索：**品味生活好夫人**，进入店铺主页\n2. 点任意商品，进到商品详情页\n3. 在价格下方，会显示**已售XXXX件**（平台对外展示的单品销量，是前台公开数据）\n> ⚠️限制：**没有店铺整体累计总销量**，只能逐个商品看单品已售；平台不会在店铺首页展示整店总销量\n\n## 二、商家自己（抖店后台，完整真实销量，含全店/单品/分时段）\n### PC端抖店后台\n1. 登录【抖店网页版】→【电商罗盘】\n    - 看**整店总销量**：罗盘 →【交易】→【全店成交分析】，可筛选时间，看成交订单数、GMV\n    - 看**每个单品销量**：罗盘 →【商品】→商品列表，搜索“Wifer”相关商品，查看成交订单、销量、渠道拆分（直播/短视频/商城）\n\n### 手机端（抖店APP）\n抖店APP →【数据】→【数据罗盘】，同样可以看商品、交易成交数据\n\n## 三、第三方工具（蝉妈妈/新抖等，查竞品参考数据）\n在蝉妈妈/新抖搜索店铺名「品味生活好夫人」，可抓取前台已售、估算店铺销售，**属于估算值≠官方真实后台数据，仅参考**\n\n## 补充重要说明\n1. 商品详情页的“已售”是**前台对外展示口径**，和商家后台罗盘的成交订单数统计口径会存在差异（退款、订单合并等影响）\n2. 普通用户**无法查到这家店铺全部商品加总的官方总销量**，平台没有开放这个前台入口\n","source_capture_status":"captured","source_cards":[{"ordinal":1,"title":"商品概览& 详情-如何分析商品不同渠道成交数据和单品直播高光片段?-抖音电商学习中心，抖店官方教你运营抖音小店","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHJAanDCCT8b?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=0fce23c7-ba10-4e8d-ba13-29448cd6e11f","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHJAanDCCT8b?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=0fce23c7-ba10-4e8d-ba13-29448cd6e11f","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":2,"title":"抖音电商罗盘最新最全介绍手册(达人版)-抖音电商学习中心，抖店官方教你运营抖音小店","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/113166?btm_ppre=a4977.b5856.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=140da441-3f9b-4ace-b852-84e3badf920e","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/113166?btm_ppre=a4977.b5856.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=140da441-3f9b-4ace-b852-84e3badf920e","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":3,"title":"抖音商品销量查询全攻略！#抖音商品 #抖音商品推荐 #抖音商品销量 #抖音商品销量排行榜","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7648897981651183046","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7648897981651183046","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":4,"title":"抖音电商-学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cHSLjJ4EXZ57/cHSLjJ4EXZ57lHSLwWrdnmCx?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=map","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cHSLjJ4EXZ57/cHSLjJ4EXZ57lHSLwWrdnmCx?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=map","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":5,"title":"罗盘双11大促作战攻略","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cHcPPwSCPcym/cHcPPwSCPcymlHcQ92eWjfgY?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cHcPPwSCPcym/cHcPPwSCPcymlHcQ92eWjfgY?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school